              "text": "rigoler — \"to laugh, to have fun (informal)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "On a bien rigolé pendant la soirée. We had a good laugh at the party."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Informal. Tu rigoles! — you are joking!"
            }
          ]
        },
